# Airflow DAGs

DAGs live in `zoomcamp/airflow/`. They orchestrate **dlt** (and Spark/dbt), they are not the ingest library.

- Tasks are **idempotent**; set retries on external HTTP/S3 calls.
- Order: bronze (dlt/raw) → silver (Spark or dlt typed) → warehouse load → `dbt build`.
- Do not embed TfL keys in DAG source; read env / Airflow Variables / `.env`.
- Sensors on freshness are optional; keep the first DAG thin enough to demo.

```python
# ❌ BAD
download_and_spark_and_dbt = PythonOperator(...)  # one giant task

# ✅ GOOD
ingest_dlt >> spark_silver >> load_motherduck >> dbt_build
```
